# deposit
## User can add deposit to his account
## edit whe requirmens for deposit will be available

### POSITIVE CASE - deposit to personal account with amout 5000/4999/1/2
POST http://localhost:4111/api/v1/accounts/deposit
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Basic a2lyaWxsOm15UGFzczI1IQ==

{
  "id": 1,
  "balance": 100000
}

### NEGATIVE CASE - deposit to personal account with amout 5001/0/-1
POST http://localhost:4111/api/v1/accounts/deposit
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Basic a2lyaWxsOm15UGFzczI1IQ==

{
  "id": 1,
  "balance": -1
}


### NEGATIVE CASE - deposit to someone elese's account with amout
POST http://localhost:4111/api/v1/accounts/deposit
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Basic a2lyaWxsOm15UGFzczI1IQ==

{
  "id": 2,
  "balance": 5000
}


### NEGATIVE CASE - deposit to doesnt existed account account+*
POST http://localhost:4111/api/v1/accounts/deposit
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Basic a2lyaWxsOm15UGFzczI1IQ==

{
  "id": 3000,
  "balance": 5001
}

