# transfer
## User can transfer money from 1  his account to another his account
### POSITIVE CASE: transfer to anothers user account with amount 1/10000/9999 - enougth money
POST http://localhost:4111/api/v1/accounts/transfer
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Basic a2lyaWxsOm15UGFzczI1IQ==

{
  "senderAccountId": 1,
  "receiverAccountId": 2,
  "amount": 9999
}
### POSITIVE CASE: transfer to self user account with amount 1/10000/9999 - enougth money
POST http://localhost:4111/api/v1/accounts/transfer
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Basic a2lyaWxsOm15UGFzczI1IQ==

{
  "senderAccountId": 1,
  "receiverAccountId": 3,
  "amount": 1
}
### NEGATIVE CASE: transfer to anothers user account with amount 1/10000/9999 - money not enought
POST http://localhost:4111/api/v1/accounts/transfer
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Basic a2lyaWxsOm15UGFzczI1IQ==

{
  "senderAccountId": 1,
  "receiverAccountId": 2,
  "amount": 9999
}

### NEGATIVE CASE: transfer to self user account with amount 1/10000/9999 - money not enought
POST http://localhost:4111/api/v1/accounts/transfer
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Basic a2lyaWxsOm15UGFzczI1IQ==

{
  "senderAccountId": 1,
  "receiverAccountId": 3,
  "amount": 1
}

### NEGATIVE CASE: transfer to anothers user account with amount -1/0/10001
POST http://localhost:4111/api/v1/accounts/transfer
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Basic a2lyaWxsOm15UGFzczI1IQ==

{
  "senderAccountId": 3,
  "receiverAccountId": 2,
  "amount": 10001
}


### NEGATIVE CASE: transfer to self user account with amount -1/0/10001
POST http://localhost:4111/api/v1/accounts/transfer
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Basic a2lyaWxsOm15UGFzczI1IQ==

{
  "senderAccountId": 3,
  "receiverAccountId": 1,
  "amount": 10001
}


### NEGATIVE CASE: transfer to not existed user account with amount 1/10000/9999
POST http://localhost:4111/api/v1/accounts/transfer
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Basic a2lyaWxsOm15UGFzczI1IQ==

{
  "senderAccountId": 3,
  "receiverAccountId": 4,
  "amount": 1000
}

### NEGATIVE CASE: transfer from not existed user account
POST http://localhost:4111/api/v1/accounts/transfer
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Basic a2lyaWxsOm15UGFzczI1IQ==

{
  "senderAccountId": 4,
  "receiverAccountId": 3,
  "amount": 1000
}

### NEGATIVE CASE: transfer from not another user account
POST http://localhost:4111/api/v1/accounts/transfer
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Basic a2lyaWxsOm15UGFzczI1IQ==

{
  "senderAccountId": 2,
  "receiverAccountId": 3,
  "amount": 1000
}


