# edit name
### POSITIVE CASE - name with 2 words and 1 space without numbers
PUT http://localhost:4111/api/v1/customer/profile
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Basic a2lyaWxsOm15UGFzczI1IQ==

{
  "name": "Kirill Beria"
}
###

### NEGATIVE CASE - name with 2 word and 2 spaces without numbers
PUT http://localhost:4111/api/v1/customer/profile
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Basic a2lyaWxsOm15UGFzczI1IQ==

{
  "name": "Kirill  Beria"
}

